# ADR-0314 (F-35, F-46): PULL with no open result is a protocol breach,
# never a SUCCESS: one FAILURE, then the server closes the connection.
!: BOLT 4.4
!: AUTO HELLO

C: PULL {"n": -1}
S: FAILURE {"code": "Neo.ClientError.Request.Invalid", "message": "Message of type PullMessage cannot be handled by a session in the READY state."}
S: <EXIT>
